                <pb facs="1123" n="1107" sameAs="frus:frus1950v04/pg1107"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>An article entitled “Is War with Russia Inevitable? Five Solid Arguments for
                    Peace,” written by the Counselor of the Department <pb facs="1124" n="1108"
                        xml:id="pg1108"/> of State, George F. Kennan, was printed in the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Reader’s Digest</hi> for March 1950, and has been
                    reprinted in the Department of State <hi rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>,
                    February 20, 1950, pages 267–271, 303.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
